                        


Item #:  SCP-5295

Object Class:  Safe

Special Containment Procedures:  SCP-5295 is to be kept in a locked box, to prevent unauthorised reading, unless being used for testing. During testing, SCP-5295 and at least 5 D-Class personnel must be locked in a standard humanoid containment cell to prevent SCP-5295-1 from breaching containment.

Description:  SCP-5295 is an anomalous fiction storybook that changes it's content every 5-7 days. When SCP-5295 is read by a human the first 3-5 chapters will seem normal compared to an average storybook but all chapter after chapter 5 has been recorded to become darker and more of a horror story. These chapters have been named the . When a human begins to read the Devils chapters their mental state instantly starts to deteriorate. The more that is read, the quicker the deterioration.

SCP-5295 will start to mention SCP-5295-1 in chapter 10 and more frequently in chapters following chapter 10. SCP-5295-1 is a humanoid creature created by SCP-5295 that appears in the book and is described in SCP-5295's pages to kill at least 3 humans in gruesome detail. Its appearance can be widely varied but all previous testing has shown it to take a humanoid form. SCP-5295-1 will appear in the reader's dreams, the frequency of it appearing depends on how much of SCP-5295 was read.

As soon as the last chapter has been read (assuming all other chapters have also been read) the reader will instantly have a severe stroke and die. Within 2 minutes of the reader's death, SCP-5295-1 will begin to emerge from the readers head and proceed to kill the same number of humans as SCP-5295 described it to in the chapters proceeding chapter 10. After all the required humans have been killed the entity will return to SCP-5295 and seemingly merge with the book. All attempts to prevent SCP-5295-1 from killing humans have been unsuccessful. All attempts to prevent SCP-5295-1 from returning to SCP-5295 have been unsuccessful.

Addendum: 

Recovery Log


SCP-5295 was recovered in Utah where multiple people were being found massacred with a storybook found close to them. A recovery team retrieved SCP-5295 and brought it back to the facility for testing.

Breach log


SCP-5295-1 breached containment when it was required to kill 10 humans. It took a large form The entity was able to kill all 10 humans in 6 minutes and 32 seconds. It then returned to SCP-5295 and merged with it.







                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
